            "review_title": "Review at Kuc",
            "review_text": "Jess B\nBangkok, Thailand4 contributions\n0\nGreat pizza and perfectly cooked wings\nJul 2019 • Couples\nMe and my partner were staying right down the street from this spot, it is just barely open in July, but they have the best bbq pizza in town. The crust is very light, a bit chewy but has that crunch texture to it. I was told they made their own pulled pork here also. \nBeing a wild wangs fan, I had to tried out their wings, and they def didn't let me down. We got a large size 8pcs wings, with half lemon pepper and half cajun, they added a homemade vietnamese pickle on the side, and those wangs are off the chart.\nThe only downside is that this place is a bit small, but it is a truly hidden gems.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 29, 2019",
